{
  "story": "INV-7's named exception to INV-6: a period's stretch is the one its first-written statement gives, and a later statement of the same transaction with another stretch changes nothing of it. The store's extension of the period in force shows in the status's currentPeriod. So the same two statements in two arrival orders leave the period with different stretches.",
